@startuml
' Figure 47.3  The control round from both sides
' Reading order: top to bottom. The interviewer gives the card; the
' candidate puts permission outside the model at minute three; the
' one probe comes at minute sixteen; the answer that closes the gap
' is amber, the policy's color; the interviewer writes six items
' with minutes, and the judgment line last.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Interviewer" as I <<org>>
participant "Candidate" as C <<org>>
participant "Policy" as P <<policy>>
I -> C : $640, new card
C -[$POLICY]> P : Min 3: policy decides
I -> C : Min 16: model fooled?
C -[$POLICY]> I : Engine still says no
I -> I : Six items, minutes
@enduml
